/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Miller, Heinrich; Helm, Veit; Steinhage, Daniel (2025): ANT 1998/99: AWI airborne Radio-Echo Sounding data over central Dronning Maund Land for the EPICA DML ice core site selection (EPICA project) [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.974402
Abstract:	This dataset contains airborne radar data acquired using the AWI EMR system during the Antarctic season of 1998/99. The profiles extend across the western Dronning Maud Land on the plateau and along the ice divide between the EDML ice core and Dome Fuji. Additionally, the profiles cover coastal areas around the catchment of the Ekström Ice Shelf. The data are available as netCDF files (including waveforms and metadata), KML files of the profile line locations, and quicklook images of the radargrams.
Keyword(s):	AWI EMR Radar; Dronning Maud Land; East Antarctica; EDML; Ekström; Ice core; ice divide; Ice Sheet; Ice shelf; Polar 2; radio-echo sounding
Related to:	Dreier, Marcel; Koch, Moritz; Gourmelon, Nora; Blindow, Norbert; Steinhage, Daniel; Wu, Fei; Seehaus, Thorsten; Braun, Matthias Holger; Maier, Andreas; Christlein, Vincent (2025): IceAnatomy: a benchmark dataset and methodology for automatic ice boundary extraction from radio-echo sounding data. The Cryosphere, 19(11), 5337-5359, https://doi.org/10.5194/tc-19-5337-2025
